==English==

===Etymology===
{{prefix|in|literacy|lang=en}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en-us-illiteracy.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~|illiteracies}}

# {{label|en|uncountable}} The [[inability]] to [[read]].
#: '''''Illiteracy''' is widespread in certain areas of the country.''
# {{label|en|uncountable}} The portion of a population unable to read, generally given as a percentage.
# {{label|en|countable}} A word, phrase{{,}} or grammatical turn thought to be characteristic of an illiterate person.

